  "description": {
   "en": "In the Empire of Isletia, there is a saint named Serilta who came with a revelation that victory and peace will continue as long as they exist.\n\nAt night when everyone is asleep, men who came to visit with a secret request try to tease Saint Serilta. However, they are beaten by Serilta who opened her eyes instead!\n\n‘How can this be a noble and upright saint?’\n\nContrary to their expectations, two incubi and the crown prince fall for the tough and sexy saint, and hope to be beaten by her instead!\n\nThe beginning of a thrilling and sexy high-level romance."
  },
